      "message": "I think we can still get here if a client sends sa_sequenceid \u003d\u003d 0 on a newly created slot:\n- nfs4_op_create_session() allocates fc_slots with gsh_calloc(), so a new slot starts with sequence \u003d\u003d 0 and cached_result \u003d\u003d NULL.\n- If a client sends sa_sequenceid \u003d\u003d 0 on an unused slot, sess_slot-\u003esequence \u003d\u003d arg_SEQUENCE4-\u003esa_sequenceid is true while cached_result is NULL, which will hit this branch and log a LogCrit (and return NFS4ERR_RETRY_UNCACHED_REP instead of NFS4ERR_SEQ_MISORDERED).",
